Usage: cardano-cli dijkstra transaction sub-transaction sign --sub-tx-file FILEPATH
                                                               [--signing-key-file FILEPATH
                                                                 [--address STRING]]
                                                               --out-file FILEPATH
                                                               

  Sign a sub-transaction

Available options:
  --sub-tx-file FILEPATH   Input filepath of the JSON unsigned sub-transaction.
  --signing-key-file FILEPATH
                           Input filepath of the signing key (one or more).
  --address STRING         Byron address (Base58-encoded).
  --out-file FILEPATH      Output filepath of the JSON signed sub-transaction.
  -h,--help                Show this help text
